what REDS 20260916.002306 closed a beginner door whose formula named an operation this tree does not declare, and the page that seats the notation says on its own face that two guards read it and a wrong formula travels past both. Build the reading nothing holds: over living tracked .md, inside untagged fenced blocks, on lines carrying ->, take every call-form token name( and ask whether tracked .rye declares fn name. A formula block under an Erratum heading is a quoted elder and is read past, since an erratum keeps every word by law. Measured now: 8 tokens over 5 pages, 7 live, 4 declared, 3 undeclared -- all three the noun infusion where the module declares infuse.
